      "qualification": "Complete historical CRT/mains and 50/60-hertz account, descriptive and explicitly not live-outlet instructions; complete cycles distinguished from directional half-cycles.",
      "sourceFormulaOrNumberChanged": false
    },
    {
      "sourceRefs": [
        "p0059#1"
      ],
      "qualification": "Mean drift in an approximately constant-property ohmic conductor with linear quasistatic behavior and short carrier-response time; no instantaneous resistor relation imposed on general RLC circuits.",
      "sourceFormulaOrNumberChanged": false
    },
    {
      "sourceRefs": [
        "p0059#2"
      ],
      "qualification": "Finite field propagation; propagation time much shorter than period and negligible distributed charge accumulation for equal instantaneous current in the same unbranched lumped circuit.",
      "sourceFormulaOrNumberChanged": false
    },
    {
      "sourceRefs": [
